= Vegetable Staticks by Stephen Hales
{c}
{parent=Plant biology bibliography}
{title2=1727}

https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/item/10333

Original experiments by <Stephen Hales> on plant perspiration and sap pressure. Chapter III, pp. 100–103, describes the vine experiments; the scanned copy at https://darwin-online.org.uk/converted/pdf/1827_Hales_Vegetable_staticks_A4453.pdf reproduces these pages.

= Organic Chemistry in its Applications to Agriculture and Physiology by Justus von Liebig
{c}
